{% comment %}
  File name: how-to-clean.liquid
  Purpose: Responsive "How to Clean" informational page section
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign section_width = section.settings.content_width | default: 760
%}

<section
  id="HowToClean-{{ section.id }}"
  class="how-to-clean-section"
  style="
    --htc-background: {{ section.settings.background_color }};
    --htc-heading-color: {{ section.settings.heading_color }};
    --htc-text-color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    --htc-accent-color: {{ section.settings.accent_color }};
    --htc-content-width: {{ section_width }}px;
    --htc-padding-top-desktop: {{ section.settings.padding_top_desktop }}px;
    --htc-padding-bottom-desktop: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_desktop }}px;
    --htc-padding-top-mobile: {{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
    --htc-padding-bottom-mobile: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
  "
>
  <div class="how-to-clean-section__container">
    <div class="how-to-clean-section__stack">
      {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}
        <header class="how-to-clean-section__header">
          <h1 class="how-to-clean-section__title">
            {{ section.settings.heading | escape }}
          </h1>
        </header>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="how-to-clean-section__content rte">
        {% if section.settings.intro_heading != blank %}
          <p class="how-to-clean-section__intro-heading">
            {{ section.settings.intro_heading | escape }}
          </p>
        {% endif %}

        <p>
          Discover the optimum way to enjoy the benefits of your copper water
          bottle! While it's perfectly fine to drink the water immediately after
          pouring, for enhanced effects, we recommend filling the bottle the night
          before. Kickstart your day by sipping a cup in the morning to cleanse
          and detoxify your digestive system, relishing the remaining water
          throughout the day.
        </p>

        <p>
          Upon receiving your copper water bottle, follow the cleaning
          instructions outlined in the instructional video below to ensure
          optimal usage.
        </p>

        <p>
          To harness the full benefits of copper, let the water rest in the
          bottle for at least 6–8 hours. Our recommendation: indulge in 1 liter
          of copper-infused water daily. Elevate your hydration routine with our
          copper water bottle for a refreshing and health-conscious lifestyle.
        </p>

        {% if section.settings.show_video and section.settings.video_url != blank %}
          <div class="how-to-clean-section__video-wrapper">
            {% if section.settings.video_url.type == 'youtube' %}
              <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/{{ section.settings.video_url.id }}"
                title="{{ section.settings.video_title | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            {% elsif section.settings.video_url.type == 'vimeo' %}
              <iframe
                src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/{{ section.settings.video_url.id }}"
                title="{{ section.settings.video_title | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        <h2>Cleaning Your Copper Water Bottle: A Simple Guide</h2>

        <p>
          Keep your copper water bottle pristine with these easy steps! Squeeze
          half a lemon, or use ¼ cup of naturally fermented vinegar, and add a
          tablespoon of salt into the bottle. Then add 1–2 cups of warm water.
          Give it a good shake and pour out the liquid.
        </p>

        <p>
          For potential copper build-up at the lid, use the squeezed lemon to
          wipe inside the neck or threads of the bottle and follow up with a
          cloth.
        </p>

        <p>
          Remember, avoid the dishwasher and steer clear of soaps or detergents,
          as they may damage the copper.
        </p>

        <p>
          Should you notice the lid sticking slightly, it could be due to copper
          deposits. A quick fix is to periodically rub a touch of natural oil,
          such as olive or coconut oil, around the lid and ridges on the top of
          the bottle.
        </p>

        <p>
          Ensure longevity and cleanliness for your copper water bottle with
          these simple care tips!
        </p>

        <h2>Optimal Care for Your Copper Vessel: Unveil Its Timeless Shine</h2>

        <p>
          Experience the enduring allure of your copper vessel with proper care.
          Initially, a protective layer of food-grade lacquer graces its exterior,
          safeguarding the beautiful copper color. While this lacquer naturally
          wears off over time, enhancing the vessel's longevity is simple—avoid
          rubbing lemon on its exterior surface while the lacquer is still
          present.
        </p>

        <p>
          As your vessel gracefully ages and begins to develop a natural patina,
          revel in the inherent charm of oxidizing copper. For those who prefer
          the original shine, follow this straightforward long-term care routine:
        </p>

        <ol class="how-to-clean-section__steps">
          <li>Sprinkle a pinch of salt on a slice of lemon.</li>

          <li>
            Allow the salt to dissolve, creating a potent cleaning mixture.
          </li>

          <li>
            Gently rub this mixture on the vessel's surface to naturally remove
            the patina and restore the copper's brilliance.
          </li>

          <li>
            Complete the process with a thorough rinse and diligent drying.
          </li>
        </ol>

        <p>
          Discover the timeless beauty of your copper vessel by embracing its
          evolution and maintaining its shine with our simple care tips. Unveil
          the radiance within for a lasting and stunning companion in your daily
          rituals.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% style %}
  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--htc-background);
    color: var(--htc-text-color);
    padding-top: var(--htc-padding-top-desktop);
    padding-bottom: var(--htc-padding-bottom-desktop);
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} *,
  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} *::before,
  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: calc(var(--htc-content-width) + 40px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-right: 20px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100%;
    gap: 34px;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__header {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__title {
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--htc-heading-color);
    font-family: var(--heading-font-family, inherit);
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 48px);
    font-style: var(--heading-font-style, normal);
    font-weight: var(--heading-font-weight, 600);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__content {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--htc-content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--htc-text-color);
    font-family: var(--text-font-family, inherit);
    font-size: {{ section.settings.body_font_size }}px;
    font-style: var(--text-font-style, normal);
    font-weight: var(--text-font-weight, 400);
    line-height: {{ section.settings.body_line_height | divided_by: 10.0 }};
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-align: left;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__content > * {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__content > *:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__content p {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__intro-heading {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    color: var(--htc-text-color);
    font-size: 1em;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__content h2 {
    margin-top: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--htc-heading-color);
    font-family: var(--heading-font-family, inherit);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 25px);
    font-style: var(--heading-font-style, normal);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__steps {
    margin: 6px 0 24px;
    padding-left: 26px;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__steps li {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    padding-left: 4px;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__steps li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__steps li::marker {
    color: var(--htc-accent-color);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__video-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 30px 0 36px;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000000;
    border-radius: {{ section.settings.video_border_radius }}px;
  }

  #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__video-wrapper iframe {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} {
      padding-top: var(--htc-padding-top-mobile);
      padding-bottom: var(--htc-padding-bottom-mobile);
    }

    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__container {
      max-width: 100%;
      padding-right: 20px;
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__stack {
      gap: 26px;
    }

    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__title {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 10vw, 38px);
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__content {
      font-size: {{ section.settings.body_font_size_mobile }}px;
      line-height: {{ section.settings.mobile_line_height | divided_by: 10.0 }};
    }

    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__content p {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__content h2 {
      margin-top: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 21px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__steps {
      padding-left: 23px;
    }

    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__video-wrapper {
      margin: 24px 0 30px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 374px) {
    #HowToClean-{{ section.id }} .how-to-clean-section__container {
      padding-right: 16px;
      padding-left: 16px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "How to Clean",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopify-section--how-to-clean",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Content"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Page heading",
      "default": "How to Clean"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "intro_heading",
      "label": "Intro heading",
      "default": "Directions for use"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Instructional video"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_video",
      "label": "Show instructional video",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "video_url",
      "id": "video_url",
      "label": "YouTube or Vimeo URL",
      "accept": [
        "youtube",
        "vimeo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "video_title",
      "label": "Video accessibility title",
      "default": "How to clean a copper water bottle"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "video_border_radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 30,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Video corner radius",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Layout and typography"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "content_width",
      "min": 560,
      "max": 1000,
      "step": 20,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Content width",
      "default": 760
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "body_font_size",
      "min": 14,
      "max": 22,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Desktop text size",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "body_font_size_mobile",
      "min": 14,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Mobile text size",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "body_line_height",
      "min": 14,
      "max": 22,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "Desktop line height",
      "default": 17,
      "info": "17 represents a line height of 1.7."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "mobile_line_height",
      "min": 14,
      "max": 22,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "Mobile line height",
      "default": 17,
      "info": "17 represents a line height of 1.7."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Colors"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "heading_color",
      "label": "Headings",
      "default": "#1a1a1a"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Body text",
      "default": "#333333"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "accent_color",
      "label": "Number accent",
      "default": "#9b5a32"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Desktop spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top_desktop",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 160,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "default": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom_desktop",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 160,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Mobile spacing"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "default": 56
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "How to Clean"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}